</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Our existing or new loan
products and changes to our platform could fail to attain sufficient market acceptance for many reasons, including, but not limited to:</p><div>

