</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">In June 2018, our board of
directors authorized a share repurchase program, under which we may repurchase up to US$20.0 million of our ADSs or ordinary shares. In
September 2022, our board of directors adopted a share repurchase program, which approves and authorizes us to repurchase through one
or more transactions up to US$20 million worth of our ADSs representing our ordinary shares. The share repurchase program previously adopted
