per ADS under the new share repurchase program. For detailed information on our share repurchase programs, see &#8220;Item 16E. Purchases
of Equity Securities by the Issuer and Affiliated Purchasers.&#8221; Our share repurchase program could affect the price of our stock
and increase volatility and may be suspended or terminated at any time.</p><div>

