                                            third-party funding partners or by our subsidiaries, depending on the specific product structure.
                                            With respect to the loans funded by third parties, the funds are provided solely by institutional
                                            funding partners, such as commercial banks, internet banks, trusts, microloan companies and
                                            consumer finance companies. We charge third-party funding partners, and guarantee companies,
