</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Meanwhile, as our AI-powered systems and data-driven service capabilities
continues to develop, we have begun to generate revenue from providing intelligent marketing and referral arrangements, technology services
