</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">As an AI-powered Fintech platform specializing in digital consumer
lending, insurance and financial technology innovation in China, our company and the VIEs are regulated by various government authorities,
including, among others:</p><div>

