the prior written consent of Hengyuda. The equity interest pledge agreements remain effective until Yiren Financial Information and its
shareholders discharge all their obligations under the contractual arrangements. We have registered the equity pledge with the relevant
office of the Administration for Market Regulation in accordance with the PRC Property Rights Law.</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><i>&#160;</i></p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in"><i>Powers of Attorney</i>.
Pursuant to the powers of attorney, each shareholder of Yiren Financial Information has irrevocably appointed Hengyuda to act as such
