wealth products and services provided through Yiren Select.</td></tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">We believe this adjustment
allows for a clearer understanding and representation of our diverse operations and strategic focus. For details on each business segment,
see &#8220;Item 4. Information on the Company&#8212;B. Business Overview.&#8221;</p><div>

