</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-align: justify; text-indent: 0.25in">Our accrued expenses and
other liabilities include primarily accrued payroll and welfare, tax payable, payable to investors and accrued advertisement expenses.</p><div>

