afterwards with each payment contingent upon the acquired businesses achieving certain pre-agreed performance targets. We had made a total
amount of RMB1,410 million of contingency payments to CreditEase before CreditEase waived the remaining RMB1,217 million contingency payments
in December 2019.</p><div>

