<td style="width: 0.25in"/><td style="width: 0.25in"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif">&#9679;</span></td><td style="text-align: justify">such amount allocated to the current taxable year and any taxable years in the U.S. holder&#8217;s holding
period prior to the first taxable year in which we are a PFIC, or pre-PFIC year, will be taxable as ordinary income;</td></tr></table><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in">&#160;</p><div>

</div><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.5in; text-align: justify; text-indent: -0.25in"></p><div>

