<td style="width: 0in"/><td style="width: 0.25in; text-align: left"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt"><b>2.</b></span></td><td style="text-align: justify"><b>SUMMARY OF SIGNIFICANT ACCOUNTING POLICIES &#8212; continued</b></td>
