<ix:continuation id="_NewAccountingPronouncementsPolicyPolicyTextBlock-c0_cont_1"><p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">In
December 2023, the FASB issued ASU 2023-09 &#8220;Improvements to Income Tax Disclosures&#8221; (&#8220;ASU 2023-09&#8221;). ASU 2023-09
intends to improve the transparency of income tax disclosures. </span>The Group adopted this guidance on January 1, 2025 and the guidance
