<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0; text-indent: 20pt">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify">The Group&#8217;s financial investments consist
of trading securities, held-to-maturity investments and other financial investments.</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in"><span style="text-decoration:underline">Trading securities</span></p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in">&#160;</p>

<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">As
of December 31, 202</span>5, the Group&#8217;s trading securities mainly consisted of investments in marketable debt or equity
assets held by the Group with the intention of selling them in the near future to earn a profit through price fluctuations. The
