<p style="font: 10pt Times New Roman, Times, Serif; margin: 0pt 0 0pt 0.25in; text-align: justify"><span style="font-family: Times New Roman, Times, Serif; font-size: 10pt">The
Group leases certain office premises to support its core business under non-cancelable leases. The Group determines if an arrangement
is a lease at inception. Some lease agreements contain lease and non-lease components, which the Group chooses not to account for as separate
components as the Group has elected the practical expedient. As of December 31, 202</span>5, the Group had no long-term leases that were
classified as a financing lease. As of December 31, 2025, the Group had no significant lease contract that has been entered into but not
yet commenced.</p>

